==English==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|mono|cotyledon}}

===Pronunciation===
{{rfp|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|botany|lang=en}} Any plant belonging to the {{taxlink|Monocotyledones|class}} (also written ''Monocotyledonae)'' or [[Liliopsida]], a class in the [[Angiospermae]], the [[flowering plant]]s. This group include the [[grass]]es, [[lilies]], [[orchid]]s and [[palm]]s.

====Usage notes====
* Outside definitions or strict taxonomic usage, {{term|monocot}} is the preferred form.

====Synonyms====
* [[monocot]]
* [[liliopsid]]

====See also====
* [[dicotyledon]]

